				<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Interviewed by <a href="http://www.rollingstone.com/music/features/madonna-to-kanye-west-dont-go-to-awards-shows-looking-for-justice-20150302" target="_blank">Rolling Stone</a> Magazine, <strong>Madonna</strong> talks again <strong>Taylor Swift</strong>. Check it out:</p>
<blockquote class="pixcode  pixcode--testimonial  testimonial testimonial--small-text">
    <div class="testimonial__content">
<p>She has an opinion, and she&#8217;s going against the norm. So in that respect, she is similar to me. And also, people just want to give her a hard time all the time because they think she&#8217;s a goody-two-shoes, so of course I want to embrace her.</p>
</div>

    </blockquote>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The post <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com/madonna-on-taylor-swift-shes-going-against-the-norm/20150303">Madonna on Taylor Swift: &#8220;She&#8217;s going against the norm.&#8221;</a> appeared first on <a rel="nofollow" href="http://drownedmadonna.com">Madonna news new album Rebel Heart</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
